                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6e7f2566-4268-3702-a96c-86807ff9bdd6",
                        "entry_id": "e7135f93-0bd3-30dd-8b8a-18771a3a2d40",
                        "glosses": [
                            "связанный, соотносящийся по значению с существительным клан; свойственный клану, характерный для него"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "016360f3-3264-4cfd-a0e7-fa5f2f4fdf6e",
                                "sense_id": "6e7f2566-4268-3702-a96c-86807ff9bdd6",
                                "text": "Именно Взгорья с их клановой системой были средоточием шотландского национального духа; именно они послужили оплотом якобитов; именно они же в наибольшей степени пострадали от карательных походов англичан, в особенности от жестокой расправы, которую учинил над непокорными кланами герцог Камберлендский."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d846237c-c59e-4331-b3ef-c1e3849784af",
                        "source_entry_id": "e7135f93-0bd3-30dd-8b8a-18771a3a2d40",
                        "source_sense_id": "6e7f2566-4268-3702-a96c-86807ff9bdd6",
                        "target_lang_word": "clan",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "clan",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac0d1e47-b45e-3a95-9635-d9c8db65217a",
                                        "entry_id": "4f4ba1cb-fe6e-39f2-9354-04e2b3628792",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A group of people all descended from a common ancestor, in fact or belief, especially when the exact genealogies are not known."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f2a3d6c-015c-3326-bf58-718ceef4582d",
                                        "entry_id": "4f4ba1cb-fe6e-39f2-9354-04e2b3628792",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A traditional social group of families in the Scottish Highlands having a common hereditary chieftain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e2f703e3-7dce-372a-a4bd-4657eefce79e",
                                        "entry_id": "4f4ba1cb-fe6e-39f2-9354-04e2b3628792",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any group defined by family ties with some sort of political unity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9cb25a1-c4da-42ce-8a7f-9d162a4f8983",
                                                "sense_id": "e2f703e3-7dce-372a-a4bd-4657eefce79e",
                                                "text": "As a rule, you see, I'm not lugged into Family Rows. On the occasions when Aunt is calling to Aunt like mastodons bellowing across primeval swamps and Uncle James's letter about Cousin Mabel's peculiar behaviour is being shot round the family circle... the clan has a tendency to ignore me."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a0675f8-0e18-371c-ae1a-22a5edb041aa",
                                        "entry_id": "4f4ba1cb-fe6e-39f2-9354-04e2b3628792",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A group of players who habitually play on the same team in multiplayer games."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1ef193a-b17b-3880-b6b1-88af6620830e",
                                        "entry_id": "4f4ba1cb-fe6e-39f2-9354-04e2b3628792",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A badger colony."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
